# Routed controllers were looked up by a name with `::` and `_` dropped, so
# `Admin::WidgetsController` and `AdminWidgetsController` shared a key and
# one of them — with its namespace — was unreferenced, clear, while its
# action said a route named it.
dead app Admin::WidgetsController=convention-only AdminWidgetsController=convention-only Admin=none
